# Huginn Shell: our own desktop shell (Python host + QML) on Huginn's compositor. Its windows are layer-shell surfaces
# through Huginn's own QML module (org.huginn.layershell, built from qt/ by build.sh); networks and Bluetooth it asks
# NetworkManager and BlueZ for itself, over D-Bus.
qml6-module-qtquick
qml6-module-qtquick-window
qml6-module-qtquick-layouts
qml6-module-qtquick-effects
qml6-module-qtquick-shapes
qml6-module-qtqml-workerscript
python3-pyside6.qtcore
python3-pyside6.qtgui
python3-pyside6.qtqml
python3-pyside6.qtquick
python3-pyside6.qtdbus
wl-clipboard    # clipboard history (Super+V): wl-paste --watch keeps it, wl-copy brings one back
